      "message": "feat(sketch)!: quick ops - shapes by dimensions as profiles with a 2D Contour\n\nSketchRecipe in camcraft-geometry compiles a rectangle (optional\ncorner radius), a circle, an obround or a regular polygon to exact\nlines, arcs and circles. A bad dimension is refused by name and never\nclamped.\n\nA Sketch keeps its recipe. The project file stores it (v85) and checks\non load that the recipe gives the stored outline bit for bit.\n\nNew undoable commands: CreateSketchRecipe, EditSketchRecipe and\nAddQuickOp (the profile and a 2D Contour on it, one undo step). An edit\nwrites the new outline and stales the operations on the profile.\n\nMCP: add_sketch_recipe, edit_sketch_recipe and add_quick_op.\n\nThe UI form is follow-up #4464.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: project files are v85; a v84 reader refuses them.\n\nFixes #3194\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
